<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Airgas raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Airgas raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it upgraded Airgas Inc to a buy from its previous rating of long-term buy based on the pullback in the share price over the last six weeks.</p>
<p>-- said Airgas can achieve greater than 25 percent earnings per share growthover the next five years.</p>
<p>-- set a one-year price target of $27 a share.</p>
<p>-- Airgas lost 1/8 to 19-3/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
